

CREATE OR REPLACE VIEW top_roi AS
SELECT r.title, r.roi, r.budget, r.revenue, p.director, p.lead_actor
FROM top_roi r
JOIN person p ON p.person_id = r.person_id   -- adjust join key to your schema
ORDER BY r.roi DESC
LIMIT 10;


Insights:

Paranormal Activity generated ~129x ROI on a ~$20K budget, the dataset’s highest return.

Horror and documentary dominate the ROI leaderboard.

Unknown actors (e.g., Michael C.) led some of the most profitable projects, showing ROI doesn’t require star power.
